## 7. Preprocessing & Cleaning Recommendations

### 7.1 Current State
The dataset comes clean and ready to use, but optional preprocessing:

```python
import re

def preprocess_shakespeare(text):
    """Optional preprocessing for specific tasks"""
    
    # Remove stage directions (optional)
    text_no_directions = re.sub(r'\[.*?\]', '', text)
    
    # Normalize whitespace
    text = re.sub(r'\s+', ' ', text)
    
    # Keep original punctuation (preserve styling)
    # text = text  # Recommended: keep as-is
    
    return text

def extract_play(text, play_name):
    """Extract specific play from dataset"""
    pattern = f"({play_name.upper()}|The {play_name})"
    match = re.search(pattern, text, re.IGNORECASE)
    if match:
        start = text.rfind('\n', 0, match.start())
        end = text.find('\n\n\n', match.end())
        return text[start:end]
    return None
```

